  "name": "PZM-02 - Nightly Report [Demo]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📌 PZM-02 — Nightly Report [Demo]\n\n**Owned By:** [Nama kamu / Pisza Mako]\n**Last Updated:** 2026-09-02\n\n**Description:**\nJalan tiap malam, rekap omset/jumlah order/menu terlaris dari tab\nAuto-Order, kirim ke WA pemilik via Fonnte.\n\n**Flow Steps:**\n1. Cron trigger (tiap malam, 22:00 WIB)\n2. Ambil semua row Auto-Order hari itu\n3. Hitung agregat (total omset, jumlah order, menu terlaris)\n4. Simpan hasil agregat ke tab Rekap Harian (untuk dashboard frontend)\n5. Format ringkasan teks\n6. Kirim ke WA pemilik via Fonnte\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Credential: Google Sheets OAuth2\n- Credential: Fonnte API (Header Auth)\n- Global Error Workflow: ErrorHandler [Global]\n\n**Ganti sebelum jalan:**\n- SPREADSHEET_ID_HERE, FONNTE_ENDPOINT_HERE, OWNER_WHATSAPP_NUMBER_HERE\n",
        "height": 668,
        "width": 724
      },
      "id": "bd5a552b-86b7-4b00-b2de-0070eff800af",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
